  "releaseNotes": "Typed procedural algorithm graphs with constant folding, common-expression elimination, dead-branch specialization, generated scalar/SIMD executors and a NativeAOT interpreter fallback. Compose planetary recipes and import LOD-resolved noise stacks; compile the same graphs to device-resident terrain with Tedd.FastNoise.Gpu.",
